Subject: Cantor SJS Compiled Lookahead Repository Slice Observation P0 P04 Windows No Follow Containment Addendum 2026-08-31

@ [research_uuid] 0c2a0cc6-35c1-4c52-af36-dd9caf507398
@ [canonical_uuid] f1fd1689-f290-4be6-ad82-e36d58103e1b
@ [runner_audit_commit] 4d93550b6b1948a8bea3c54cf1973be05afa6014

& [LocalDependencyEvidence]
  + pinned windows-sys 0.61.2 Win32 Storage FileSystem surface exposes GetFileAttributesW CreateFileW GetFileInformationByHandle GetFinalPathNameByHandleW FILE_ATTRIBUTE_REPARSE_POINT FILE_FLAG_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT and FILE_FLAG_BACKUP_SEMANTICS
  + cantor_ecosystem already enables Win32 Storage FileSystem so no dependency or network change is required

& [NoFollowDesign]
  + walk every absolute path component from its prefix and reject absent invalid or FILE_ATTRIBUTE_REPARSE_POINT components before canonical equality
  + open the final executable repository Git directory and index identities with OPEN_EXISTING and FILE_FLAG_OPEN_REPARSE_POINT adding BACKUP_SEMANTICS only for directories
  + compare handle-derived final paths and stable file identity metadata before and after rather than trusting textual canonicalization alone
  + on non-Windows platforms perform the corresponding component walk with symlink_metadata and reject every symbolic-link component

& [ContainmentDesign]
  + do not call the B1 crate-private containment function or construct its permit
  + implement an RSO-private permit produced only after full request validation and consumed by a closed GitOperation runner
  + mirror suspended create job assignment kill-on-close output-drain deadline and terminate-on-overflow semantics on Windows while retaining a bounded kill-and-wait path on other supported hosts

& [RequiredAdversariesBeforeObservation]
  + executable repository ancestor Git directory index and requested-path reparse or symlink substitution each refuse
  + timeout stdout overflow stderr overflow nonzero exit extra child process and pre-post file identity drift each terminate and refuse all output
  + arbitrary command and arbitrary argument construction remain unrepresentable

& [Effects]
  + local dependency source inspection only with zero Git invocation process start repository observation mutation provider model network or external effect
